ignoreMixedLogicalExpressionsDefault.ts:8:15 lint/nursery/useNullishCoalescing ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  i Use ?? instead of ||.
  
     7 │ // `||` mixed with `&&`
   > 8 │ const r1 = (a || 'default') && b;
       │               ^^
     9 │ const r2 = a || (b && c);
    10 │ 
  
  i The || operator checks for all falsy values (including 0, '', and false), while ?? only checks for null and undefined.
  
